AI: Aap "do" keh rahe hain, kya aap "do-while" loop ka example chahte hain Java ya Python mein? Ya phir koi specific "do" related programming concept chahiye?

Yahan dono language mein simple do-while loop (ya uska equivalent) ka example de raha hoon:

---

### Java: do-while loop example

```java
import java.util.Scanner;

public class DoWhileExample {
    public static void main(String[] args) {
        Scanner scanner = new Scanner(System.in);
        int num;

        do {
            System.out.print("Koi number daalein (0 pe program rokega): ");
            num = scanner.nextInt();
            System.out.println("Aapne dala: " + num);
        } while(num != 0);

        System.out.println("Program khatam hua.");
        scanner.close();
    }
}
```

### Python mein do-while jaisa loop:

Python mein direct do-while loop nahi hota, lekin hum aise bana sakte hain:

```python
while True:
    num = int(input("Koi number daalein (0 pe program rokega): "))
    print(f"Aapne dala: {num}")
    if num == 0:
        break

print("Program khatam hua.")
```

---

Agar aap kisi aur cheez ke liye "do" keh rahe the, toh thoda clarify kar dein. Main madad karunga!
